{"path":"chrono/year_month_weekday/ok","title":"std::chrono::year_month_weekday::ok","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::chrono::year_month_weekday::</span>ok","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_weekday/ok","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"Checks if this year_month_weekday object represents a valid date.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> ok<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Checks if this <code>year_month_weekday</code> object represents a valid date.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if this <code>year_month_weekday</code> object represents a valid date, that is, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">year<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">ok</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> month<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">ok</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> weekday_indexed<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">ok</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> and there are at least <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_weekday/accessors\"><code>index()</code></a> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_weekday/accessors\"><code>weekday()</code>s</a> in the specified year and month. Otherwise <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cassert&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;chrono&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> ymwdi<span class=\"br0\">{</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/weekday\"><span class=\"kw2579\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">Wednesday</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"sy2\">/</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"sy2\">/</span><span class=\"nu0\">2021</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>ymwdi.<span class=\"me1\">ok</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    ymwdi <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year\"><span class=\"kw2636\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">year</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2021</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy2\">/</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2621\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">month</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy2\">/</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/weekday\"><span class=\"kw2579\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">Wednesday</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">42</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">!</span>ymwdi.<span class=\"me1\">ok</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"},{"path":"chrono/year_month_weekday","title":"std::chrono::year_month_weekday"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::chrono::year_month_weekday::ok","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++20. Checks if this year_month_weekday object represents a valid date."},{"label":"Return value","note":"true if this year_month_weekday object represents a valid date, that is, year().ok() && month().ok() && weekday_indexed().ok() is true and there are at least…"},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":67,"codeBlockCount":1}
